title: "Safety Issue Tracking: A Scoped ServiceNow Application"
abstract: >-
  A scoped ServiceNow application built in App Engine Studio,
  demonstrating custom table design and a role-based security model
  with per-operation, row-level, and field-level access control,
  packaged as an importable update set.
